    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d261">

                <pb facs="0357" n="259" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg259"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cridler to consul, Shanghai.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Statement true. Conger’s message stated— <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>In British legation under continued shot and shell from Chinese troops.
                            Prompt relief necessary to prevent massacre.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cridler.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
